---
// GuideSection.astro
---

<section id="guide" class="space-y-8 pt-8 border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-3">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
      Essential Aspirant Advice
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
      Why Signatures Get Rejected in Indian Govt Portals
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      Thousands of candidates face application rejection every year due to technical signature discrepancies. Follow these crucial guidelines to ensure your submission passes automated validation on the first attempt.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Rejection Reasons Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        1
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Signing in Capital Letters (ALL CAPS)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        SSC, IBPS, and Railway RRB explicitly state that signatures in <strong>BLOCK / CAPITAL letters</strong> will be disqualified. A signature must be your customary running cursive hand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        2
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">File Size Below Minimum (e.g. &lt; 10 KB)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Portals like SSC CGL and IBPS reject files below <strong>10 KB</strong> just as strictly as files over 20 KB. SignResize uses smart precision compression that guarantees your file lands strictly between 10 KB and 20 KB.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        3
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Dark Shadow & Gray Paper Background</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Photos taken under indoor yellow lighting or casting telephone shadows are rejected by OCR scanners. Our <strong>Clean White Paper</strong> tool algorithmically whitens the paper while maintaining sharp ink density.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Mobile Photo Guide -->
  <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 space-y-6">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
      How to Capture & Resize Your Signature on Mobile (4 Easy Steps)
    </h3>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 01</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Sign on Clean White Paper</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Use an unruled, plain A4 white sheet. For SSC and IBPS, use a <strong>black ink pen</strong> (gel or ballpoint).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 02</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Photograph in Day Light</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Hold your phone directly above the paper. Ensure no hand shadows fall across the signature area.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 03</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Select Your Exam Preset</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Upload your image to SignResize. Click your target exam (e.g. SSC, UPSC) to apply official dimensions and KB limits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 04</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Auto-Clean & Download</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Toggle <strong>Clean White Paper</strong> to remove phone shadows, then tap Download to get your portal-ready JPG.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
